Thanks for the PR! I pushed a few changes. `block()`, `success()`, `error()`, `warning()` and `note()` of `SymfonyStyle` already escape their message. Escaping before calling them printed backslashes, for example `Template name "@ns\<info\>/missing.html.twig" not found`. I also kept the existing JSON flags, so that the output doesn't change on a patch release.

